8cb34de9-346e-4a04-ba99-ca654a43e903/12209-0
02:15:35.139 --> 02:15:35.539
Soh.

8cb34de9-346e-4a04-ba99-ca654a43e903/12253-0
02:15:36.899 --> 02:15:40.636
Two things. One,
you need to check when you're processing

8cb34de9-346e-4a04-ba99-ca654a43e903/12253-1
02:15:40.636 --> 02:15:44.566
in your kernel code that you're not
processing invalid data.

8cb34de9-346e-4a04-ba99-ca654a43e903/12253-2
02:15:44.566 --> 02:15:49.848
Like you don't want these threads to try
to process data in the image because the

8cb34de9-346e-4a04-ba99-ca654a43e903/12253-3
