that some of these threads therefore

8cb34de9-346e-4a04-ba99-ca654a43e903/12261-0
02:15:56.539 --> 02:16:00.686
are diverging and going to have to do
something different,

8cb34de9-346e-4a04-ba99-ca654a43e903/12261-1
02:16:00.686 --> 02:16:06.659
and that is going to ultimately slow down
the execution anytime you have divergence.

8cb34de9-346e-4a04-ba99-ca654a43e903/12268-0
02:16:09.619 --> 02:16:12.979
But you can see the bigger this image
gets.

8cb34de9-346e-4a04-ba99-ca654a43e903/12292-0
02:16:14.579 --> 02:16:20.041
The smaller, relatively,
these boundaries are going to be,

8cb34de9-346e-4a04-ba99-ca654a43e903/12292-1
02:16:20.041 --> 02:16:25.779
the more negligible the impact is. Right?
So that's the goal.

8cb34de9-346e-4a04-ba99-ca654a43e903/12307-0
02:16:26.899 --> 02:16:31.769
If you had instead of four, you know,
in here you had 400 by 400,

8cb34de9-346e-4a04-ba99-ca654a43e903/12307-1
