Proportionally,
this boundary edge effect can become

8cb34de9-346e-4a04-ba99-ca654a43e903/12361-1
02:16:50.627 --> 02:16:55.384
substantially less significant.
And at some point, it's inevitable. Like,

8cb34de9-346e-4a04-ba99-ca654a43e903/12361-2
