8cb34de9-346e-4a04-ba99-ca654a43e903/12397-2
02:17:10.697 --> 02:17:15.247
numbers of warps,
because that's the way it maps. You know,

8cb34de9-346e-4a04-ba99-ca654a43e903/12397-3
