Now normally when you're dealing with
most images are just byte, you know,

8cb34de9-346e-4a04-ba99-ca654a43e903/12535-1
02:18:22.806 --> 02:18:28.211
0 to 256 valued 8 byte,
8 bit integers typically.

8cb34de9-346e-4a04-ba99-ca654a43e903/12535-2
